Hi,

just wondering who is posting the FAQ in this newsgroup. Seems it
is getting misused right now - people are asking questions about 
IBM PC Games which are binary releases without source code supplied
and thus without patches for the source.
The correct newsgroups for these kind of questions are:
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.action
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.adventure
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.announce
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.flight-sim
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.misc
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.rpg
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.strategic

AFAIK, this newsgroup accompanies the comp.sources.games newsgroup.
Haven't seen the FAQ in a while. Anyone got a recent copy? Please mail
it to me and I'll start posting it here periodically.

-Sven
